      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Personas NUNCA fazem git commit/\npush/MR -- so o orquestrador, so em\nSec9 (ou mid-pipeline c/ commit_policy)\nSubagents nao chamam Task() entre\nsi (flat orchestration) -- escalam\nQUESTION: / APPROVAL_NEEDED: /\nREQUEST_MAIN:\n1 control file por ticket: _state.json\n+ _notes.md (nunca context.json)\n--skip, --manual, --review, --resume,\n--max-iterations, --max-plan-iterations",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
